<title>USA: CENFED Financial sets 10 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>CENFED Financial sets 10 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>PASEDENA, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CENFED Financial Corp said Wednesday it had declared a 10 percent stock dividend, payable May 2, record April 17.  </p>
<p>The company said it also declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.09 a share, payable May 2. The company also paid $0.09 a share previously.</p>
<p>The stock dividend in effect gives shareholders a 10 percent increase in the quarterly cash dividend, the company said.</p>
</text>
